  "607808440877973726": {
    "text": "---\n\n## 給 howhow 使用者的 Pull 指令\n\n```bash\ngit fetch origin\ngit checkout -b howhow origin/howhow\ngit submodule update --init --recursive\n```\n\n## Agent_skills 有異動時（兩步推送）\n\n```bash\n# Step 1: 進入 submodule，推到 Agent_skills 遠端 main\ncd Agent_skills\ngit add <files>\ngit commit -m \"描述\"\ngit push origin main\n\n# Step 2: 回到主 repo，更新 submodule ref 推到 howhow\ncd ..\ngit add Agent_skills\ngit commit -m \"chore: update Agent_skills submodule ref\"\ngit push origin howhow\n```\n",
